  "description": "Add a burst of electric color to your next project with this neon horizontal stripe seamless pattern. Featuring vivid pink, yellow, blue, and green, this bold design combines brilliant rose, chartreuse, han purple, and medium spring green for a lively, high-contrast look. The repeating horizontal stripes create a fun visual rhythm that works beautifully across digital paper, colorful backgrounds, packaging, and print projects. Whether your style leans toward retro pop art or playful modern graphics, this vibrant striped pattern is an easy way to make your creations stand out.\n✨What’s Included:\n• 15 seamless patterns\n• Format: JPEG\n• Size: 3600 × 3600 px\n• High-resolution digital files\n✨Perfect for:\n• Scrapbooking and junk journals\n• Digital paper and printable backgrounds\n• Fabric prints and textile designs\n• Wrapping paper and gift packaging\n• Planners, notebooks, and stationery\n• Y2K, retro, and pop art projects\n• Party invitations and decorations\n• Stickers, cards, and crafts\n• Social media graphics and digital collages\n• Bold branding and creative DIY projects",
